  "title": "Two Years In, GE Vernova Is Reshaping the Energy Future",
  "summary": "The world’s demand for energy is growing at a pace that’s increasingly difficult to match — and two years into its journey as a standalone company, GE Vernova is meeting the challenge head-on. The company is helping energy customers find reliable, cost-effective solutions for today that can be quickly scaled to meet the needs of tomorrow. Here are just a few of them. Electrifying the Future of Data Centers and AI",
